<title>UK: Air London profits rise, sets special payout.</title>
<headline>Air London profits rise, sets special payout.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.9		   vs 7.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.1		    vs 2.4</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 6.0		    vs 4.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     2.2		    vs 1.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   35.0		   vs 29.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Air London International Plc said it also proposed paying a special dividend of 10p per share.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 1.9		    vs 0.8</p>
<p> Net taxed		  1.4		    vs 0.7</p>
<p> Attributable	     1.3		    vs 0.7</p>
<p> Pay date		   Dec. 18</p>
<p>Div registration date  Nov. 19  Ex-div date		Nov. 11</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
